  "notes": "{渡|わた}る means to cross or go across from one side to another.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{渡|わた}す→渡す：02442_watasu⟧ (transitive, to hand over)\n\nPARTICLE:\nUses を for the thing being crossed:\n- ⟦{橋|はし}→橋：02163_hashi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{渡|わた}る: to cross a bridge\n- ⟦{道|みち}→道：00505_michi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{渡|わた}る: to cross a street\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{橋|はし}→橋：02163_hashi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{渡|わた}る: to cross a bridge\n- ⟦{信号|しんごう}→信号：03258_shingou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{渡|わた}る: to cross at a traffic light\n- ⟦{海|うみ}→海：00556_umi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{渡|わた}る: to cross the ocean\n- ⟦{世|よ}→世：00424_yo⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{渡|わた}る: to spread widely\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{渡|わた}り{鳥|どり}→渡り鳥：09252_wataridori⟧: migratory bird\n- {渡|わた}り⟦{歩|ある}く→歩く：00538_aruku⟧: to wander from place to place",
